BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Thedirt": "https://thedirt.online/event/left-of-the-dial-presents-mitch-polzak-live/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:thedirt
X-SOURCE:The Dirt
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260605T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260605T220000
DTSTAMP:20260605T210915
CREATED:20260512T173235Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260524T184530Z
UID:10078941-1780687800-1780696800@thedirt.online
SUMMARY:Left of the Dial presents: Mitch Polzak Live
DESCRIPTION:The big guy from out West with larger than life energy (he’s also 6’5’\, the great grandson of August Ringling of the Ringling Bros Circus and related to Ma Barker of the infamous Barker Gang)\, guitarist\, singer\, banjoist\, songwriter\, composer\, entertainer\, musical historian and teacher\, Mitch Polzak wears his heart on his sleeve and his playing in his heart. Mitch was inducted into The Western Swing Hall Of Fame in 2024 and has been twice nominated for The Ameripolitan Music Awards. \nPolzak performs Rockabilly\, Honky Tonk\, Surf\, Bluegrass\, Western Swing\, and Cajun music stateside and abroad. Mitch performs with the religious fervor of Jerry Lee Lewis and Johnny Cash\, and delivers a Honky Tonk ballad with the sincerity of Merle Haggard and Waylon Jennings. Polzak will bring a room to a fevered pitch of joyous energy on the dance floor and then tell you a story in a song like two old friends sitting at a kitchen table at midnight. \nHe has released 8 albums\, 5 on his own label Polzak Productions and 3 on the Spanish based Sleazy Records. \n  \n 
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/left-of-the-dial-presents-mitch-polzak-live/
LOCATION:The Melon Ball – Watermelon Music\, 1970 Lake Blvd\, Suite #1\, Davis\, California\, 95616\, United States
CATEGORIES:Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Mitch.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Watermelon Music":MAILTO:watermelonmusicdavis@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Thedirt": "https://thedirt.online/event/french-twist/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:thedirt
X-SOURCE:The Dirt
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260606
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260630
DTSTAMP:20260605T210915
CREATED:20260521T043640Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260521T043640Z
UID:10079003-1780704000-1782777599@thedirt.online
SUMMARY:French Twist
DESCRIPTION:The Artery presents “French Twist” featuring the paintings and ceramics of Cathie James-Robinson and Amanda Cadelago. Cathie and Amanda’s show was inspired by their visit to France a few years ago. Cathie’s paintings feature the natural world\, particularly the wetlands’ plant life and birds. Her hand-built ceramics include detailed sculptures\, small pots and vases. Amanda Cadelago paints playful interiors\, collected objects\, florals\, birds\, and animals. Her vibrant compositions explore the emotional pull of color\, design\, memory\, and personal symbolism. Amanda’s work exudes warmth\, humor\, and curiosity. The reception for this exhibit is on Friday\, June 12\, 6-9 pm coinciding with the Davis Second Friday ArtAbout.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/french-twist/
LOCATION:The Artery\, 207 G Street\, Davis\, CA
CATEGORIES:Art
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Cathie-Robinson-French-Window-with-Curtain.jpeg
GEO:38.5438665;-121.73916
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The Artery 207 G Street Davis CA;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=207 G Street:geo:-121.73916,38.5438665
END:VEVENT
