UID:10000707-1780761600-1780779600@hatefreetogether.org
SUMMARY:Davis Pride Festival
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate community\, visibility\, and joy at Davis Pride 2026\, one of Northern California’s most vibrant and welcoming Pride events. The annual festival returns on Saturday\, June 6\, at Davis Civic Center Park (6th & B Streets). Attendees can expect a lively mix of live music\, drag performances\, community vendors\, local organizations\, and interactive activities. Pride begins at 4:00 pm. \n  \nOrganized by the Davis Phoenix Coalition\, the festival continues to uplift marginalized voices while fostering connection\, advocacy\, and belonging. Beyond the main festival\, Davis Pride is part of a broader lineup of events that span early June and invite participation from students\, families\, and activists alike. \n  \nThe event is free and open to all ages. \nInterested in making a donation? Go to: https://davisphoenixcoalition.app.neoncrm.com/forms/recurring-donation-form \n  \nFor questions and more information\, visit the Davis 2026 Pride Festival website.
URL:https://hatefreetogether.org/event/davis-pride-festival/
LOCATION:Civic Center Park\, 6th & B Streets\, Davis\, 95616\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://hatefreetogether.org/wp-content/uploads/Davis-Pride-6.1.24-Event-198.webp
END:VEVENT
