 mmunication and Relationships\n	Warning Signs\n	Trauma-Informed Skills/De-
 escalation and Leadership\n	Next Steps/Taking Action/Action Plan\n\n\nProg
 ram will be in Spanish and English\n\nParticipants must register in advanc
 e HERE \n\nBecome a part of our team. For the welfare of the community!\
