  that aim to ACTIVATE\, WAKE-UP\, and EMPATHIZE. Hundreds of people will s
 ee our messages in 60 minutes! We have a lot of fun and receive hundreds o
 f honks\, thumbs up\, and power fists. All you have to do it show up and w
 ave! Details provided upon registration. Look for the email you receive af
